  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">今天即可购买服务器，与好友一起畅玩！点击 <a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/gamerpotion\">这里</a> 或下方横幅，并使用代码 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 享受 25% 折扣！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/gamerpotion\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/684/717/cbf4e971-7207-4602-bd76-b44081f9b7df.png\" alt=\"\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/gamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/buy me a coffee-support-orange?style=plastic\" /></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/870825743788158986?color=blue&amp;style=plastic\" /></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/GamerPotionDev\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/my other-projects-orange?style=plastic\" /></a> <a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/gamerpotion\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/get%20a%20server-click%20here-blue?style=plastic\" /></a><br />&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>DarkMining</h2>\n<p><br />原版挖矿每次破坏方块仅掉落 1 个物品。使用 DarkMining，你将有几率获得额外掉落物！挖掘矿石可获得钻石和绿宝石，或在沙子中寻宝…… |&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.gamerpotion.net/2022/12/darkmining-better-block-drops.html\">查看更新日志</a></p>\n<p><em>支持服务端安装。你只需在服务端安装此模组，无需在客户端安装。</em></p>\n<p>由制作 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a> 的同一团队打造（如需完整 RPG 体验，请获取 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG 整合包</a>，尽情体验任务与 RPG 玩法）</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>功能特性</h2>\n<p>（得益于以下功能，你的原版游戏体验将得到进一步提升）</p>\n<p>- 原版标准方块被挖掘或破坏时仅掉落 1 种特定物品。现在，你在挖掘时有几率获得一些稀有物品。</p>\n<p>- 寻找食物？去挖掘泥土或下界岩试试。</p>\n<p>- 寻找钻石或绿宝石？去挖掘矿石，甚至能获得双倍的标准奖励！</p>\n<p>- 寻找更多稀有物品？去挖掘一些末地方块吧。</p>\n<p>- 掉落基于权重系统计算。你将必定获得原版标准掉落物，并有机会获得额外物品。<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br /></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/679/75/darkminingnew2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"837\" height=\"1000\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/545/269/2022-12-11_12.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"837\" height=\"440\" />&nbsp;</p>\n<p>使用许可 - 欢迎自由将其用于你的整合包中。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>点击下方横幅立即获取服务器！或访问 <a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/gamerpotion\">BisectHosting.com</a>&nbsp;，请务必使用代码 '<strong>gamerpotion</strong>' 以享受 25% 折扣。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/gamerpotion\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/608/745/bisect-banner-large3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"621\" height=\"415\" /></a></p>",
